WEBVTT

00:00:01.270 --> 00:00:06.056
Step 1: Verify the starting page

00:00:06.056 --> 00:00:08.056
Step 2: Type a title for the new meeting into the meeting title field

00:00:06.755 --> 00:00:09.445
Step 3: Set the meeting date to a near-future date

00:00:09.445 --> 00:00:11.445
